steadyStateEquations -- creates steady-state equations of a reaction network
****************************************************************************

Description
===========

Obtain the steady-state equations for a given network. Before any equations can
be created, you must invoke the *note createRing: createRing, function, which
creates the reaction network ring. If you do not create the ring, you will
receive an error message.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : N = reactionNetwork "A <--> 2B, A + C <--> D, B + E --> A + C, D -->    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = A-->2B                                                                  |
|     2B-->A                                                                  |
|     A+C-->D                                                                 |
|     D-->A+C                                                                 |
|     D-->B+E                                                                 |
|     B+E-->A+C                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : ReactionNetwork                                                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|B+E"                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = createRing(N, QQ)                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : steadyStateEquations N                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = | xx_B^2kk_{1, 0}-xx_Axx_Ckk_{2, 3}+xx_Bxx_Ekk_{4, 2}-xx_Akk_{0, 1}+xx_ |
|     | -2xx_B^2kk_{1, 0}-xx_Bxx_Ekk_{4, 2}+2xx_Akk_{0, 1}+xx_Dkk_{3, 4}      |
|     | -xx_Axx_Ckk_{2, 3}+xx_Bxx_Ekk_{4, 2}+xx_Dkk_{3, 2}                    |
|     | xx_Axx_Ckk_{2, 3}-xx_Dkk_{3, 2}-xx_Dkk_{3, 4}                         |
|     | -xx_Bxx_Ekk_{4, 2}+xx_Dkk_{3, 4}                                      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     Dkk_{3, 2} |                                                            |
